      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Marcus and Andre seem to fit in a gritty urban crime drama, given their street-smart vibes and immersion in the city's underbelly. Julian and Elena are more suited for a polished high-society drama, with Julian's calculated calmness being a perfect fit for high-stakes financial scenes and Elena's elite social persona aligning with the glamorous world of high society. Hiroshi's disciplined, tech-savvy character would also work well in both, but his role could lean slightly towards the high-society drama with his cybersecurity role.\n\nRemember to inject fresh perspectives and avoid creating characters purely based on predictable traits. Crafting unique backstories and distinct motivations can prevent falling into cliches.",
